{
    "background_story": "Buster was a fearless space explorer who traveled the galaxy in his trusty spaceship, the 'Astral Quest'. On one of his many adventures, he found himself hurtling towards a distant planet with a malfunctioning engine. With no other option, Buster activated his retrorocket, a device that used reverse thrust to slow down his ship. The retrorocket roared to life, and Buster felt a intense force pushing him back into his seat. As the ship slowed, Buster expertly navigated through the planet's atmosphere, dodging debris and asteroids. With the retrorocket's help, he landed safely on the planet's surface, earning him the nickname 'The Rocket Master'. From that day on, Buster's legendary retrorocket maneuver was etched in the annals of space exploration history.",
